{title: Lagan Laagi Tumse Man Ki Lagan}
{artist: Rahat Fateh Ali Khan Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] O Laagi [D] Tum Se Man Ki Lagan,        Lagan Laagi [A] Tum Se Man Ki Lagan [D]
Gali-Gali [E] Ghume [Bm] Dil Tujhe [A] Dhundhe,        Gali-Gali [E] Ghume [Bm] Dil Tujhe [A] Dhundhe
[Bm] Tere Bin [A] Tarase Nayan,        [A] O Laagi [D] Tum Se Man Ki Lagan
[A] Aa Ja O Meri [Bm] Jaan,        [A] Mere Dil Ka [F#m] jahaan
[E] Maange Teri [F#m] Khabar,        [D] Dhoondhe [Bm] Tera Nish [A] aan
[A] Laagi [D] Tum Se Man Ki Lagan,        Lagan Laagi [A] Tum Se Man Ki Lagan
Gali-Gali [E] Ghume [Bm] Dil Tujhe [A] Dhundhe,        Gali-Gali [E] Ghume [Bm] Dil Tujhe [A] Dhundhe
[Bm] Tere Bin [A] Tarase Nayan,        [A] O Laagi [D] Tum Se Man Ki Lagan
[A] Tera Tujhako Saunp De,        [E] Kya Laagat Hai [A] Mor
Mera [D] Mujhamen Kuchh Naaheen Jo,        [Bm] Hovat So [A] Tor
[A/D] Tere Bin Mera [A] Mann,        [A/D] Jaise Ban Men [A] Hiran
